name c01m06-war-hammer
timeout 900
time 1994-10-07T06:00:00Z

# ARMORED FIST (NovaLogic 1994), CAMPAIGN ONE "OVERWATCH", MISSION 6 OF 7 — `INDIA6`, WAR HAMMER.
# THE SEVEN DISCLOSURES D1-D7 are stated in full in c01m01-slaughterzone.fbm and apply here unchanged.
#
# THE TASK [FSW]: neutralise the enemy IN-FIELD REFUEL DEPOT. Course 224 SSW for Echo 1, with ECHO 2 ON
# 211 AND ECHO 3 ON 258 — the only mission in Overwatch whose briefing states a separate course per
# platoon, and this file flies all three. Time limit 15 min [FSG].
#
# ENVELOPED FROM THE OUTSET, AND THE ENVELOPMENT DOES NOTHING. [GUIDE p.68] has Bandits 1-3 converging
# from left, right and front, which is why they are laid at 134, 314 and 224 degrees from the depot.
# Being enveloped costs blue exactly nothing here: red has no sensor and no weapon (D2). The whole
# tactical proposition of this mission — three axes of fire on a company in the open — has no
# representation at all. That is the clearest single statement in this campaign of what a ground title
# needs and this engine has not got.
#
# THE APACHE IS DECLARED AND IT IS INERT. [GUIDE p.70] uses the AH-64 here as a reconnaissance platform
# because "the CCV shows what the pilot sees". The catalogue HAS an `ah64` row and it is a KINEMATIC
# MOVER: no flight model, no stations, no gun, no fire control, and its `radar_az_half_deg 0` says it
# carries no radar in this tree. So it transits, it is visible, and it reports nothing to anybody —
# there is no reconnaissance channel from a mover to another unit's picture. It is declared because the
# gap is worth having in the telemetry rather than out of it.
#
# WHAT THIS FILE DECLARES
#   Blue [GUIDE p.68]: Echo 1 = 2 M1A2 + 1 M3, Echo 2 = 2 M1A2, Echo 3 = 1 M1A2 + 1 M3. SEVEN vehicles.
#     TWO CELLS OF THAT TABLE ARE UNREADABLE and campaign.md marks them `?`: Echo 2's M3 count and
#     whether Echo 3 is "1 M1, 1 M3". Echo 2 is declared at its unambiguous 2 M1A2 and no M3; Echo 3 is
#     declared as printed. Both readings are stated here so a re-read of the guide can correct them.
#   Red  [GUIDE p.68]: Bandit 1 (3 T-80, 1 BMP), Bandit 2 (4 T-80, 1 BMP), Bandit 3 (3 T-80, 2 BMP),
#   Bandit 4 (1 T-80). Plus the refuel depot and the fuel/propane tanks [GUIDE p.68-71].
#   Goals: the DEPOT and the TANKS. The [FSW] task names the depot alone; the tanks are the guide's own
#   naming of what is in it, they carry no count, and each is declared ONCE (understated).
#
# ECHO 3'S LOSS IS EXPECTED AND UNJUDGED. campaign.md §6: "loss of Echo-3's M1 is expected and does not
# fail the run". Nothing here can shoot it (D2), so the clause has no object — the same shape as
# mission 3's Echo-2 clause.
#
# READING RULE (binding). The verdict is `m6e1a`'s UNIT_RESULT and nothing else.
#   SUCCESS/exit 0 requires the refuel depot AND the fuel/propane tanks destroyed inside 900 s. Both
#   are `target_soft` and both lie under one canister's footprint, so this mission is winnable and a
#   failure to win it is a delivery finding, not an arithmetic one.
#   The other six passes are measurements, not conditions: four canisters on Bandits 1-4 and two Mk 84
#   at Bandit 1's and Bandit 2's lead T-80 (doctrine b). Report the split and the two `aimErrM`.
#   exit 1 on a blue unit is an ENGINE finding, not a mission loss (D2).

unit m6e1a
  module f16
  team friendly
  flight echo1 1
  spawn 25.22417 68.13963 970 224.0 450       # 40 km short of the depot on Echo 1's [FSW] course 224
  set gear up
  set fuel_int_pct 100
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  set store 3 cbu87
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task attack
  set attack_mode ccrp
  wp 24.96490 67.86430 970 450                # AIM POINT: the in-field refuel depot
  wp 24.80286 67.69222 1570 450               # egress 25 km down Echo 1's axis
  objective kill unit m6depot
  objective kill unit m6tanks
  objective survive

unit m6e1b
  module f16
  team friendly
  flight echo1 2
  spawn 25.23356 68.12892 970 224.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_int_pct 100
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  set store 3 cbu87
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task attack
  set attack_mode ccrp
  wp 24.95238 67.87856 970 450                # AIM POINT: Bandit 1, converging from the left
  wp 24.80286 67.69222 1570 450
  objective survive

